  "schema:description": "The dataset contains the relative frequency shift values for the first eight weak-axis bending vibration modes obtained by simulation using Ansys, for a cantilever beam with the following dimensions: length 1000 mm, width 50 mm, and thickness 5 mm. The elements are hexahedral and have a 1 mm maximum edge size. The beam is fixed at the left end.",
